            "source_text": "to achieve pristine LiNi0.9Co0.1O2 and various LiNi0.9Co0.1O2·xLiNi0.5Mn1.5O4 composites denoted as CS-0.05, CS-0.1, CS-0.2, corresponding to x = 0.05, 0.1, 0.2, respectively"
